{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"ls -la results | head; ls ../investigation; find ../investigation ../task -name AGENTS.md; cat .codex/skills/scientific-evidence/schemas/artifact-manifest.schema.json 2>/dev/null; sed -n '1,200p' .codex/skills/validate-paper/templates/figure_manifest.schema.json; sed -n '1,100p' .codex/skills/write-paper-standalone/scripts/validate_claims.py; cat .codex/skills/retrieve-references/SKILL.md\"","aggregated_output":"lrwxrwxrwx 1 agent agent 16 Nov 12 23:44 results -> ../investigation\n_idea_generation\nattempts_history.jsonl\nbest_program_manifest.json\nconclusions.md\nconclusions_history.jsonl\nconclusions_other_workers.md\nevents.jsonl\nidea_generation_failures.jsonl\nideas\nideas_history.jsonl\nlatest_run_manifest.json\nmemory.jsonl\nmemory.md\nouter_state.json\ntask\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/vercel/skills/react-best-practices/AGENTS.md\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/build-web-apps/skills/supabase-best-practices/AGENTS.md\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/build-web-apps/skills/react-best-practices/AGENTS.md\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/data-analytics/AGENTS.md\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/zoom/AGENTS.md\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/product-design/templates/prototype/AGENTS.md\n../investigation/.agent_home/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/product-design/templates/mobile-app/AGENTS.md\n{\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"FigureFontSizes\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"description\": \"Explicit font sizes for the legacy manifest contract.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"axis\": {\n          \"title\": \"Axis\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"legend\": {\n          \"title\": \"Legend\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"ticks\": {\n          \"title\": \"Ticks\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"title\": {\n          \"title\": \"Title\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"title\",\n        \"axis\",\n        \"ticks\",\n        \"legend\"\n      ],\n      \"title\": \"FigureFontSizes\",\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"LegacyFigureManifestFigure\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"allOf\": [\n        {\n          \"else\": {\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"path_pdf\": {\n                \"minLength\": 1\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"path_pdf\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"if\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"generator\": {\n                    \"const\": \"generate-concept-figure\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"generator\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"attempted_generator\": {\n                    \"const\": \"generate-concept-figure\"\n                  },\n                  \"fallback_reason\": {\n                    \"minLength\": 1,\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"generator\": {\n                    \"type\": \"null\"\n                  },\n                  \"prompt_log_path\": {\n                    \"minLength\": 1,\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"generator\",\n                  \"attempted_generator\",\n                  \"prompt_log_path\",\n                  \"fallback_reason\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Original flat figure-manifest entry shape.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"attempted_generator\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"enum\": [\n                \"generate-concept-figure\",\n                \"matplotlib\",\n                \"tikz\",\n                \"native_latex\",\n                \"manual\"\n              ],\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"default\": null,\n          \"title\": \"Attempted Generator\"\n        },\n        \"categories_per_panel\": {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"title\": \"Categories Per Panel\",\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        \"estimated_min_rendered_font_pt\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n              \"type\": \"number\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"default\": null,\n          \"title\": \"Estimated Min Rendered Font Pt\"\n        },\n        \"fallback_reason\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"default\": null,\n          \"title\": \"Fallback Reason\"\n        },\n        \"figure_id\": {\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"title\": \"Figure Id\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"figure_type\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"grouped_bar\",\n            \"bar\",\n            \"line\",\n            \"box\",\n            \"violin\",\n            \"scatter\",\n            \"heatmap\",\n            \"table_matrix\",\n            \"table\",\n            \"composite\",\n            \"diagram\"\n          ],\n          \"title\": \"Figure Type\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"font_sizes\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FigureFontSizes\"\n        },\n        \"generator\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"enum\": [\n                \"generate-concept-figure\",\n                \"matplotlib\",\n                \"tikz\",\n                \"native_latex\",\n                \"manual\"\n              ],\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"default\": null,\n          \"title\": \"Generator\"\n        },\n        \"intended_latex_width_fraction\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n              \"maximum\": 1,\n              \"type\": \"number\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"default\": null,\n          \"title\": \"Intended Latex Width Fraction\"\n        },\n        \"max_label_chars\": {\n          \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n          \"title\": \"Max Label Chars\",\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Validate generated claim-grounding artifacts before paper finalization.\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\nimport stat\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom typing import Any\n\nKEY_RE = re.compile(r\"@\\w+\\{([^,]+),\")\nEVIDENCE_REF_RE = re.compile(r\"@evidence\\[\\[[^\\]]+\\]\\]\")\nTEX_INPUT_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"\\\\(?:input|include)(?![A-Za-z@])\\s*\"\n    r\"(?:\\{(?P<braced>[^{}]+)\\}|(?P<unbraced>[^\\s%{}]+))\"\n)\nTEX_IMPORT_COMMAND_RE = re.compile(r\"\\\\(?:input|include)(?![A-Za-z@])\")\nTEX_LOCAL_SUPPORT_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"\\\\(?P<command>usepackage|RequirePackage|documentclass|LoadClass)\"\n    r\"(?![A-Za-z@])(?:\\s*\\[[^\\]]*\\])?\\s*\\{(?P<targets>[^{}]+)\\}\"\n)\nTEX_LOCAL_SUPPORT_COMMAND_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"\\\\(?:usepackage|RequirePackage|documentclass|LoadClass)(?![A-Za-z@])\"\n)\nDYNAMIC_TEX_IMPORT_RE = re.compile(r\"\\\\csname\\s*(?:input|include)\\s*\\\\endcsname\")\nCONDITIONAL_TOKEN_RE = re.compile(r\"\\\\if[a-zA-Z@]+\\b|\\\\else\\b|\\\\fi\\b\")\nVERBATIM_ENV_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"\\\\begin\\s*\\{(?P<env>verbatim\\*?|lstlisting|minted)\\}.*?\"\n    r\"\\\\end\\s*\\{(?P=env)\\}\",\n    re.DOTALL,\n)\nPROMPT_ARTIFACT_RE = re.compile(r\".+_prompt(?:_round_\\d+(?:_contract_retry_\\d+)?)?\\.md$\")\nGENERATED_EVIDENCE_SCAN_ARTIFACT_NAMES = {\n    \"validation_feedback.json\",\n    \"validation_feedback.md\",\n    \"verification-report.json\",\n}\nROOT_GENERATED_EVIDENCE_SCAN_ARTIFACT_NAMES = {\"validation_report.json\"}\nGENERATED_EVIDENCE_SCAN_ARTIFACT_PREFIXES = (\n    \"paper_evidence_audit\",\n)\nEVIDENCE_BUNDLE_DIRNAME = \"scientific-evidence\"\nEVIDENCE_SCAN_SUFFIXES = (\n    \".tex\",\n    \".md\",\n    \".json\",\n    \".yaml\",\n    \".yml\",\n    \".py\",\n    \".sh\",\n    \".r\",\n    \".csv\",\n    \".tsv\",\n)\nEVIDENCE_SKIP_DIR_NAMES = {\n    \".git\",\n    \"__pycache__\",\n    EVIDENCE_BUNDLE_DIRNAME,\n}\nAGENT_SKILL_DIR_PREFIXES = (\n    (\".claude\", \"skills\"),\n    (\".codex\", \"skills\"),\n    (\".cursor\", \"skills\"),\n    (\".opencode\", \"skills\"),\n    (\".gemini\", \"skills\"),\n    (\".pi\", \"agent\", \"skills\"),\n)\nVERIFICATION_SUMMARY_KEYS = (\n    \"total_references\",\n    \"resolved_references\",\n    \"anchored_references\",\n    \"dangling_references\",\n    \"manifests_checked\",\n)\nSCIENTIFIC_EVIDENCE_SCRIPT = (\n    Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent.parent\n    / \"scientific-evidence\"\n    / \"scripts\"\n    / \"scientific_evidence.py\"\n)\n\n\ndef read_json(path: Path) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    \"\"\"Read JSON data from disk when available.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        payload = json.loads(path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    except json.JSONDecodeError as exc:\n        raise SystemExit(f\"Invalid JSON in {path}: {exc}\") from exc\n    if not isinstance(payload, dict):\n        raise SystemExit(f\"Expected JSON object in {path}\")\n    return payload\n\n\ndef read_bib_keys(path: Path) -> set[str]:\n---\nname: retrieve-references\ndescription: Retrieve grounded BibTeX references from Semantic Scholar Graph API, OpenAlex, or Google Scholar (`scholarly`) and write references.bib plus provenance JSON for paper generation.\n---\n\n# What the skill is about\nFetch references from Semantic Scholar Graph API, OpenAlex, or Google Scholar (via `scholarly`) and keep only real BibTeX entries.\n\n# When to use the skill\n- Final report/paper generation.\n- Related-work section needs grounded citations.\n\n# What to do\n1. Build focused search queries from task goal, method names, and top experiment ideas.\n2. Preferred path (Semantic Scholar Graph API):\n```bash\npython scripts/s2_fetch.py \\\n  --query \"query one\" \\\n  --query \"query two\" \\\n  --min-refs 8 \\\n  --max-refs 15 \\\n  --out-bib references.bib \\\n  --out-json references_provenance.json\n```\n3. Fallback path (OpenAlex):\n```bash\npython scripts/openalex_fetch.py \\\n  --query \"query one\" \\\n  --query \"query two\" \\\n  --min-refs 8 \\\n  --max-refs 15 \\\n  --search-limit 10 \\\n  --out-bib references.bib \\\n  --out-json references_provenance.json\n```\n   Optional:\n   - `--mailto you@example.com` to enter the OpenAlex polite pool\n   - Env fallback: `OPENALEX_EMAIL`\n4. Alternate path (Google Scholar API wrapper with `scholarly`):\n```bash\npython -m pip install scholarly\npython scripts/scholarly_fetch.py \\\n  --query \"query one\" \\\n  --query \"query two\" \\\n  --min-refs 8 \\\n  --max-refs 15 \\\n  --search-limit 25 \\\n  --sort-by relevance \\\n  --proxy-mode auto \\\n  --delay-seconds 0.5 \\\n  --out-bib references.bib \\\n  --out-json references_provenance.json\n```\n   Proxy options:\n   - `--proxy-mode auto|none|free|single`\n   - `--proxy-http <url>` / `--proxy-https <url>` for `single`\n   - Env fallbacks: `SCHOLARLY_PROXY_MODE`, `SCHOLARLY_PROXY_HTTP`, `SCHOLARLY_PROXY_HTTPS`\n   - Global `HTTP_PROXY` / `HTTPS_PROXY` are intentionally ignored to avoid accidental ambient proxying\n5. Require `S2_API_KEY` when available for `s2_fetch.py` (script reads env automatically).\n6. Keep only references with valid BibTeX and citation key.\n7. Dedupe by citation key and paper id.\n8. Fail hard if references found `< min-refs`.\n9. Use `s2_fetch.py` first for stability, `openalex_fetch.py` as the next fallback, and `scholarly_fetch.py` last if the other sources fail.\n\n# Outputs\n- `references.bib`\n- `references_provenance.json`\n\n# Notes\n- Use `templates/provenance.schema.json` for expected shape.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
